# 📖 Concept 2: Comparison Operators

These operators compare values.

| Operator | Meaning               | Example     |
| -------- | --------------------- | ----------- |
| `==`     | Equal to              | `age == 18` |
| `!=`     | Not equal to          | `age != 18` |
| `>`      | Greater than          | `age > 18`  |
| `<`      | Less than             | `age < 18`  |
| `>=`     | Greater than or equal | `age >= 18` |
| `<=`     | Less than or equal    | `age <= 18` |

---

# Example

```python
marks = 85

if marks > 50:
    print("Pass")
```

Output

```text
Pass
```

